   "arithmetic": "sim at cpu 0.25 (this recipe, C1): fixed 14 ms, gpu lane 29.32 ms, cpu lane 46.12 ms, 135.6 CPU-lane experts per token. CPU-lane terms other than per-expert = 46.12 - 135.6 x 0.25 = 12.22 ms (42 layers x 0.145 ms handoff + NVMe landing waits). Kit C1 10.95 tok/s = 91.32 ms/token -> MoE 91.32 - 14 = 77.32 ms = cpu lane (binding) -> (77.32 - 12.22) / 135.6 = 0.480 ms/expert. Lab C1 11.3 = 88.50 ms -> (74.50 - 12.22) / 135.6 = 0.459.",
